  "title": "Clay's AI-Powered Growth Explodes with $1.25 Billion Valuation!",
  "summary": "In just six months, AI-driven data filtering startup Clay has doubled its value to $1.25 billion, thanks to a hefty $40 million investment from Meritech. With a 6x revenue boost in 2024 and top-tier clients like OpenAI and Canva, Clay is pioneering AI in sales lead identification. Discover how their unique AI assistant, 'Claygent,' and a disruptive pricing model set them apart in the competitive tech landscape.",
